    "table surface | light wooden tabletop, back edge runs horizontally near top of frame | identical | static across all frames; no warping or shifting of the plane",
    "background room | dark, out-of-focus space above table edge with blurred diagonal chair-leg shapes | identical | static; background elements never render over foreground objects",
    "camera viewpoint | locked-off frontal shot of tabletop, no panning, zooming, or cuts | same framing at end | single continuous fixed viewpoint; all new views geometrically compatible",
    "numbered cube row | starts as two green '2' cubes with a one-cube-width gap between them | grows to eight cubes reading '2 3 2 2 3 5 2 6' in a left-to-right row | cubes added sequentially left to right; previously placed cubes hold their positions and orientation; face colors of individual cube positions vary between placements (object-state attribute, outside spatial scope)",
    "right hand | enters from top of frame gripping cubes by their top knobs | releases the final tilted blue '6' cube at the right end of the row | progresses monotonically left to right; always renders nearer than the cubes it handles, with correct near-over-far occlusion at every overlap"
